---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | MeshCalculator">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Service</h2>
    <p>MeshCalculator provides free calculation tools, reference charts, and a factory directory for the wire mesh industry. Inquiry forwarding connects buyers with manufacturers in Anping, China.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">No transaction involvement</h2>
    <p>We are not a party to any transaction between buyers and factories. Negotiation, contracts, payment, shipping, and quality disputes are solely between the buyer and the factory.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Accuracy of tools</h2>
    <p>Calculators produce theoretical estimates. Actual product weight and specs may vary. Verify all values with your supplier before relying on them for freight, engineering, or procurement decisions.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Directory listings</h2>
    <p>Basic factory listings are free. We do not charge for ranking positions and do not certify listed factories. Verification reflects document checks only, not product quality.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
